<p>misaale badr jo haasil hua kamaal mujhe<br />
ghata ghata ke falak ne kiya hilaal mujhe</p>

<p>teri madad ka faqat ya Ali bharosa hai<br />
kisi ki aaas nahi waqte inteqaal mujhe</p>

<p>kareem jo tujhe dena ho be talab dede<br />
faqeer hoo'n pa nahi aadate sawaal mujhe</p>

<p>kisi ke saammne kyu'n haath jaake phailaaoo'n<br />
mera kareem to deta hai be sawaal mujhe</p>

<p>hussain kehte the pushte faras se girta hoo'n<br />
madad ka waqt hai ae bekasi sambhaal mujhe</p>

<p>Hussain kehte the parwardigaar rahiyo gawaah<br />
ke qatl karte hai na haq ye bad qisaal mujhe</p>